    "text": "<p>For a dimerization reaction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><msup><mi>JK</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,then the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;will be &hellip;..J.</p>"
